docs/SEED_PLAN_ANALYSIS.md
docs/assets/
docs/handoff/

# ---- Evidence files named by the submission (shipped with the release) ----
# These five were excluded here before. They are now deliberately shipped so
# the evidence named in the submission is reachable. The first four are <= 64 KiB;
# docs/bulge_fixture_sweep.json (125,231 B) ships as well, because that sweep
# cannot be rebuilt from the release alone (rebuilding it needs a compiled native
# engine, which is not shipped) -- see docs/RELEASE_CONTENTS.md section 3.
#   docs/expressiveness_matrix.tsv        SUPPLEMENTARY_v1.md:7   (Table S1 source)
#   docs/NATIVE_INDEXED_ENGINE_DESIGN.md  SUBMISSION_MAIN_v1.md:717 (.ggi format)
#   docs/seed_plan_sweep.json             SUPPLEMENTARY_v1.md:35  (Table S2 source)
#   tools/expressiveness_probe.py         SUPPLEMENTARY_v1.md:14  (Table S1 evidence)
#   docs/bulge_fixture_sweep.json         SUBMISSION_MAIN_v1.md:585 (bulge sweep evidence)
# See docs/RELEASE_CONTENTS.md section 3 for the full inclusion/exclusion list.

# ---- Internal QA notes not referenced by the submission -------------------
# docs/BULGE_FIXTURE.md is internal QA material, not named by any submission
# file, so it stays out of the release (docs/RELEASE_CONTENTS.md section 3).
docs/BULGE_FIXTURE.md

# ---- Internal material not named by the submission (must not ship) --------
# Checked 2026-09-23: none of these paths is referenced by the submission files
# (docs/submission/SUBMISSION_MAIN_v1.md, docs/submission/SUPPLEMENTARY_v1.md).
# They are the manuscript itself, the figure sources, and internal QA / audit
# records, so they stay out of the published repository, consistent with the
# exclusions above (docs/PAPER_*.md, docs/assets/, docs/handoff/).
# See docs/RELEASE_CONTENTS.md section 3.
docs/submission/
docs/figures/
docs/qa/
# Internal audit record: ignored by pattern so its name never appears in a
# published ignore list (the file on disk keeps its original name).
docs/*APPLICABILITY_AUDIT.md

# ---- Internal process records -------------------------------------------
docs/OFFTARGET_HARDENING_*.md
docs/PHASE3_ACCEPTANCE.md
docs/PHASE5_ADVANCED_MODES.md
docs/refactor_plan.md
docs/UPGRADE_REPORT.md
# Release-decision record: internal, keeps the full .gitignore diff and internal
# document names, so it is not published with the release.
docs/RELEASE_CONTENTS.md

